Static Podman bundle for RSI Harness cluster image builds.

Podman with its helpers, all statically linked for x86_64 Linux, built
from the upstream sources listed in VERSIONS (licenses under licenses/).
The Harness installs it on its own; it runs from any directory.

bin/            podman, runc, crun, fuse-overlayfs, fusermount3, pasta,
                passt, slirp4netns
lib/podman/     conmon, rootlessport, netavark, aardvark-dns, catatonit
libexec/podman/ quadlet
etc/containers/ containers.conf, policy.json, registries.conf, storage.conf
SHA256SUMS      every other file in the bundle
